            "kind": "WakeflowImplementationTargetResultReport",
            "schemaVersion": 1,
            "outcome": "needs-review",
            "summary": "Appended `Wakeflow live check L19 touched this README through the tmux transport on 2026-11-02.` as the new last line of the existing `## Live check` section of Alembic `README.md`, and committed it on `main` as ab70d375be7da66793227d1e8992f0615f4cbc82 with parent 44c146212d73419abad5a187f07705cc3ee44678. Diagnosis: before the edit the checkout matched the package. It was on `main` at 44c1462 with an empty `git status --short`, and `README.md` ended with `## Live check`, a blank line, and the L13 sentence followed by one newline. Change: appended exactly the bytes `\\nWakeflow live check L19 touched this README through the tmux transport on 2026-11-02.\\n`. This leaves one blank line between the unchanged L13 sentence and the L19 sentence, and the file ends with a single newline. The diff is a pure 2-line addition (`git diff --numstat 44c1462 HEAD` reports `2 0 README.md`); no existing line was changed. The commit went through normally with no hooks bypassed. The outcome is `needs-review` rather than `completed` because this Demand has no managed evidence that this window may cite; recording the `commit` evidence is the Controller's step.",
            "repositoryChange": {
              "repositoryId": "repository_0e71a6d3-cf4f-4052-a125-e477cb1711fa",
              "disposition": "committed",
              "branch": "main",
              "commits": [
