            },
            "evidenceLocators": [],
            "verification": [
              "Baseline before edit: `git branch --show-current` printed `main`; `git rev-parse HEAD` printed 44c146212d73419abad5a187f07705cc3ee44678; `git status --short` printed nothing; `README.md` ended with `## Live check` (line 346), a blank line, and `Wakeflow live check L13 touched this README on 2026-10-28.` plus a single newline (checked with `od -c`).",
              "`git diff` before commit showed one hunk `@@ -346,3 +346,5 @@` that leaves `## Live check`, the blank line and the L13 sentence as context and adds only `+` (blank) and `+Wakeflow live check L19 touched this README through the tmux transport on 2026-11-02.`. `git diff --check` printed nothing.",
              "ac1-readme-l19-last-line, satisfied: after commit, `tail -n 5 README.md` prints `## Live check`, an empty line, `Wakeflow live check L13 touched this README on 2026-10-28.`, an empty line, `Wakeflow live check L19 touched this README through the tmux transport on 2026-11-02.`. The last heading is still `## Live check` (line 346, after `## License` at line 342). A byte dump shows the file ends with `2026-11-02.\\n` (single newline).",
              "ac2-readme-only-change, satisfied: `git show --stat HEAD` for commit ab70d375be7da66793227d1e8992f0615f4cbc82 (`docs(readme): add Wakeflow live check L19 note to the Live check section`) lists only `README.md | 2 ++` with `1 file changed, 2 insertions(+)`. `git rev-parse HEAD^` prints 44c146212d73419abad5a187f07705cc3ee44678. After commit `git status --short` printed nothing and `git branch --show-current` still prints `main`.",
              "No product build or test run: per the package's controller-only testing decision and the repository rules for documentation-only changes, only `git diff --check` was required, and it passed."
            ],
            "risks": [
              "No managed evidence was cited because none exists yet for this Demand, and recording the `commit` evidence is the Controller's step. Both anchors therefore rest on the command output quoted above until the Controller records that evidence and checks the commit itself. Residual risk is low: the change is a 2-line append that was byte-checked, and the L13 sentence and every line above it are unchanged. The commit's author date is local 2026-11-01 17:14 -0800, while the sentence says 2026-11-02 (the UTC date), exactly as the package requires. Nothing was pushed, tagged, amended or rebased, no branch was created or switched, and no other file, repository or the live16 worktree was touched."
